  "subtitle": "When The Pattern Outlives The Person",
  "tagline": "People can leave. Patterns can remain.",
  "headline": "When a Leader’s Fear Becomes the System",
  "headline_sub": "What Is This System Forming in Us?",
  "slug": "when-a-leaders-fear-becomes-the-system",
